WEBVTT

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:36.910
Mayor Cosimo, it seems the
invitations have had the intended effect.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:39.490
Indeed. The date will soon be upon us,

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:43.080
and the most important
guests have already arrived.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:47.170
This shows the empire
still holds sway across its lands.

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:49.840
What of our three guests of honor?

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:53.920
They await the proceedings
with no signs of animosity.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:57.430
Having them lose control
and ruin things before we begin

00:00:57.430 --> 00:00:59.470
has been my greatest fear.

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:03.560
But it seems we will be able
to commence without incident.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:08.610
The four claimants to the throne
shall discuss a peaceful succession

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:10.820
at the Summit of Imperial Heirs.

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:15.570
You must be tired, Your Highness.

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:20.080
You can say that again. I can't let
my guard down around that mayor.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.330
The people of Mealtars wrested
local control away from the empire.

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:28.960
And at the top is the mayor,
who has run the city for many years.

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:32.300
He <i>has </i>been of great service.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:36.800
And his support in holding
the summit has been invaluable.

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:39.180
It seems the Natran
delegation has arrived.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:42.350
Then we must go welcome them at once!

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:44.560
Why must you welcome them in person?

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:46.310
Natra is such a small kingdom.

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:50.150
Some may say Your Highness
is lowering herself to their level.

00:01:50.150 --> 00:01:53.980
They are dignitaries of an allied kingdom
and here on my invitation.

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:58.030
Any sign of disrespect would
reflect poorly on the empire.

00:01:58.030 --> 00:02:04.790
And personally welcoming them shows
how much I value our close ties to Natra.

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:10.080
Forgive my presumption.
I am humbled by Your Highness's prudence.

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:14.090
Truth be told, the main reason
is so I can enjoy seeing

00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:17.090
the sour look on Wein's face.

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:22.050
I can hardly wait. If <i>he </i>comes to <i>me</i>,

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:25.810
everyone will think
that I have close ties to Natra.

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:30.650
And as the one who invited him,
failing to greet him is not an option.

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:36.440
Wein's face is going
to twist in torment, you'll see.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:43.490
It was so kind of you to travel
all the way here to Mealtars.

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:49.160
In the name of the
Earthwold Empire, I bid you all...

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:51.620
...welcome... to...

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:52.920
Huh?

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:56.550
I would like to thank you
for your gracious invitation.

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.590
I am Falanya Elk Arbalest.

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:00.340
I have come in my brother's stead

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:04.640
to meet with Your Highness,
Princess Lowellmina.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.010
Oh...

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:09.430
This is freaking me out!

00:03:09.430 --> 00:03:11.350
I hope Falanya is all right.

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:16.440
Ninym and Nanaki are with her,
so she should be fine, but...

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:19.280
...I never expected she'd say that.

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:22.740
A ceremony commemorating
the Earthwold Empire's formation

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:26.450
will be held in Mealtars,
a city at the continent's heart,

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:29.200
and our kingdom has been invited.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:33.120
The imperial princes and their sister,
the princess, will be there,

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:35.750
and they will also hold
a Summit of Imperial Heirs.

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:38.550
Courtesy would ordinarily
dictate my attendance,

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:42.510
but our kingdom is dealing
with the aftermath of war.

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:45.680
I wish to hear your opinions as
to whether I should attend.

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:48.850
Influential figures from
across the empire will be there.

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:52.270
Cracks may appear in the
alliance if you do not attend.

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:55.110
With all that must be done after the war,

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:59.110
I fear that having Your Highness
leave now will pose a major risk.

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:02.950
Maybe I won't have to go, after all!

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:04.410
If I do end up going,

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:08.280
Lowa will use every trick in the
book to drag me into her faction.

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:11.710
But I want nothing to do
with major hassles like that!

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:16.840
I can just imagine her frustrated look
when she finds out I'm not coming.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:23.550
Falanya probably thinks
I'll have more time for her if I don't go.

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:27.140
Don't worry, little sis,
I'll make sure to do just that.

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:32.390
Can we not handle such matters
in His Highness's absence?

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:35.940
Or is that head on
your shoulders merely for show?

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:37.270
How dare you!

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:40.320
We must not miss this opportunity.

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:44.900
Your Highness's presence will allow us
to strengthen our alliance and--

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:46.660
I will go!

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:48.910
What?

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:52.870
I will attend the ceremony in your stead.

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:57.380
Your Highness,

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:00.210
let us go over what we discussed.

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:03.720
After civil war was averted in the empire,

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:06.890
many have flocked to
Princess Lowellmina's side.

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:10.180
She is now a faction in her own right.

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:13.480
She could have used that
to lay claim to the throne and--

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:15.230
But she didn't, did she?

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:20.360
That's right. She likely thinks claiming
the throne will prolong the chaos.

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:22.780
And it's bad for popular support.

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:26.360
That's why she forged a patriotic
faction to win the people over.

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:29.740
She has gathered to her side nobles
who fear for the empire's future.

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:34.410
But unlike her three princely brothers,
her faction lacks powerful figures.

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:37.080
However, the princess
is turning that on its head.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:38.670
In lieu of a military solution,

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:43.090
she is positioning herself as the one
sincerely concerned about the empire.

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:46.220
So anyone who tries to silence her

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:49.970
will be painted as
a villain for all to see.

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:53.810
She is positively devious!

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:59.560
Where is that adorable child from?

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:01.360
I've never seen her.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:05.240
But she has quite a noble bearing.

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:07.240
Princess Falanya.

00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:13.660
I thank you for joining the ceremony
so soon after your arrival.

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:16.290
Falanya? So she's the princess of Natra.

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:20.880
There was talk of her brother,
Prince Wein, marrying Princess Lowellmina.

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:25.050
Thank you for your
most gracious invitation.

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:29.590
Allow me to introduce you
to the guests of honor.

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:33.300
Huh? Wait a moment.

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:37.810
This is not good. "Guests of honor"
must mean the three princes.

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:39.480
If she introduces Falanya,

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:44.690
it will appear as if Natra is
backing Lowa in the succession battle.

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:48.280
My dear brothers,
may I have a moment of your time?

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:50.570
What do you want, Lowellmina?

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:52.990
I'd like to introduce someone.

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:55.700
Pleased to meet you, Your Highnesses.

00:06:55.700 --> 00:07:00.420
I am Falanya Elk Arbalest,
Princess of Natra.

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.210
Well, this is a surprise.

00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:06.800
I'd heard of you, Princess Falanya,
but didn't know you were so lovely.

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:09.880
If only I had learned of this sooner.

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:13.090
It is an honor to meet you,
Prince Manfred.

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:16.010
This is the one my brother spoke of.

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:19.640
Prince Manfred, the youngest
of the three, is quite cunning.

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:23.440
He is supposedly spreading
the word that he will win the throne.

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:28.440
He's gaining support from many provinces
by promising rewards upon his coronation.

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:34.160
That's right. I heard you would
be visiting instead of Prince Wein.

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:37.120
Next up, Prince Bardloche,
the middle brother.

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:39.620
His support lies in the military.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:44.040
From an early age, he was forged
into the celebrated warrior he is today.

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:48.250
I am truly sorry. My brother must deal
with the aftermath of the war.

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:53.430
I heard about that. I'd been hoping
to speak with him, but...

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:57.510
How good of you to journey here
from the northern hinterlands.

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:01.060
And last but not least,
the eldest, Prince Demetrio.

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:04.020
His support is based solely
on being the oldest son.

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:07.320
But his ability and character
leave much to be desired.

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:09.610
He's your typical ne'er-do-well son.

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:12.740
So he's like Lord Geralt,
who plunged to his death.

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:16.320
I sincerely hope he is not <i>that </i>bad.

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:21.750
To think they'd send their young princess
to such a momentous event.

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:25.830
One might think you
hold our empire in contempt.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:28.170
We think no such thing.

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:30.380
Of all the things to say.

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:36.760
Natra was invited here for the ceremony
commemorating Mealtars joining the empire.

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:39.850
It's a shame we won't see Prince Wein,

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:45.480
but is it not rude of you to treat
Princess Falanya as unworthy of your time?

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:48.230
Wouldn't you agree, dear Manfred?

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:51.780
It seems Demetrio is out of sorts.

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:54.990
Why don't we have
a little chat, Princess Falanya?

00:08:54.990 --> 00:08:56.320
Hold on, Manfred.

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:59.240
I, too, wish to hear where Natra stands.

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:05.170
--Bardloche,<i> </i>I know a warmongering fool
like you may not have a clue,

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:06.580
--Your Highness, we'll get caught up in
the princes' squabbles if we stay here.
--Bardloche,<i> </i>I know a warmongering fool
like you may not have a clue,

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:09.250
--Your Highness, we'll get caught up in
the princes' squabbles if we stay here.
--but there <i>is </i>such a thing
as waiting your turn.

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:10.090
--Your Highness, we'll get caught up in
the princes' squabbles if we stay here.
--I'm older<i> </i>than you,
so I should be next, little brother.

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:13.470
--Let us leave now.
--I'm older<i> </i>than you,
so I should be next, little brother.

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:16.630
Prince Bardloche. Prince Manfred.

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:18.640
I am flattered by your invitations,

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:22.350
but I must ask that you let me
grant that honor to another today.

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:26.060
What's this? Do you find
my company disagreeable?

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:28.150
Most certainly not.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:30.980
It's simply...

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:35.200
I already promised Princess Lowellmina
I would speak with her.

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:38.200
Why yes, that's right.

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:40.830
Forgive me, my dear brothers.

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:42.540
In that case...

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:44.250
A promise is a promise.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:47.170
Now, shall we go, Princess Falanya?

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:50.210
Yes, let us go. Please excuse me.

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:03.930
All right, what shall we do now?

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:08.810
I would not protest if you did
truly wish to speak with me.

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:11.150
Well...

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:14.030
Perhaps it would be best
if you got some rest.

00:10:14.030 --> 00:10:17.110
I shall see you again later.

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:24.450
You did well, Your Highness.

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:28.370
Ninym, do you think I, well, you know...

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:33.590
No need to look so concerned.
Your Highness performed magnificently.

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:37.670
Still, I could do so much more.

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:39.300
I've known that for some time.

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:42.390
My brother has been
getting busier and busier.

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:45.680
I've wondered whether
there was something I could do.

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:49.390
He knows that and
has encouraged me to help.

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:52.770
He told me, "You decide what to do."

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:56.440
I received my brother's
message loud and clear.

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:59.610
I'd like to take a short break.

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:03.280
Very well.

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:07.450
Forgive me, Your Highness.
I must leave your side for the moment.

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:09.120
Is something wrong?

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:13.500
I have a matter to attend to.
But don't worry. I'll be back shortly.

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:15.130
Nanaki.

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:17.010
Please look after Her Highness.

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:21.590
I wonder what's going on.

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:22.760
No idea.

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:24.550
What are you eating?

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:28.020
A pastry from over there.
They're really good.

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:30.230
I want to try one!

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:37.530
Well, if it isn't Ninym.

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:39.860
What a coincidence meeting you here.

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:44.410
Nice try, but I couldn't miss
those looks you kept flashing me.

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:46.530
I'm just playing with you.

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:49.580
Whatever. So, what do you want?

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:53.630
And please be brief. I don't like
leaving Princess Falanya's side for long.

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:54.920
How can you say that?!

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:57.590
Is she more important to you than I am?

00:11:57.590 --> 00:12:00.340
Don't be silly. Of course, she is.

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:03.970
You're so mean, Ninym!

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:07.180
No, wait! I was just kidding.

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:09.220
I'm quite busy, you know.

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:12.730
Get to the point, or I'll tell
Wein you've doubled in weight,

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:15.060
and everyone now calls you Fat-o-mina.

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:18.570
That's the worst thing you could say.

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:24.820
I wanted to speak to you about a deal,
one that I'd like to make with you.

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:26.200
A deal?

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:31.910
I'd like Princess Falanya to
declare Natra's support for me.

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:34.420
Could you put in a good word for me?

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:39.460
Surely she'd agree to support me
if you recommended it.

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:40.550
Right?

00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:42.220
And in return?

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:45.260
Do you have anything
to offer in your so-called deal?

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.680
Of course I do!

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:49.140
Can you guess what it is?

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:50.640
Out with it, already.

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:54.100
Fine, have it your way.

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:56.940
Two words: the summit.

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:02.780
--Look, everyone! This is very...

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:05.860
--Do you see that short man
speaking over there?
--Look, everyone! This is very...

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:08.700
Tall people attract attention
merely by their height.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:11.490
But when you're short,
it's hard to stand out.

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:16.790
He must be an excellent speaker
if he's attracting so many people.

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:20.210
His use of body language
and gestures also draw attention.

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:23.920
He uses visual persuasion
on top of how he speaks.

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:26.970
Dominating two of the five senses is key.

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:30.600
Their feet are all the proof you need.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:34.310
See how everyone's feet
are pointed toward the speaker?

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:36.600
That's a sign they're interested.

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:39.730
Nanaki, are you always
observing people like that?

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:41.940
I <i>am </i>a bodyguard, after all.

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:48.660
So, what's with your sudden interest
in learning how to observe people?

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:50.700
I messed up earlier.

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:57.040
Maybe it's because I let Princess
Lowellmina dominate the conversation.

00:13:57.040 --> 00:13:59.630
So I want to observe the people here

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:04.380
and learn how I can take control.

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:10.140
I came here because I wanted
to help my brother, even if just a bit.

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:15.770
I'm offering information about
the Summit of Imperial Heirs.

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:17.810
Are you not interested?

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:23.400
Well, aren't you two clever?

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:26.320
Stop, you're embarrassing me.

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:28.110
Wait, you said, "You two."

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:30.620
I received instructions from Wein.

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:34.490
He told me what to say
if you tried to strike a deal.

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:36.290
What that might be?

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:38.830
I'll give it to you verbatim.

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:42.170
"I don't need a deal, so back off."

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:44.960
I see.

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:47.720
Wein sees our empire's momentous event

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:51.430
as merely a steppingstone
for his sister's advancement.

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:53.890
He doesn't care about the empire.

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:58.770
If you want him to care,
hurry up and crown the next emperor.

00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:02.610
Otherwise, he won't give a hoot
no matter how you chirp and warble,

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:04.900
Little-Miss-Vying-for-the Throne.

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:17.200
This is unfortunate,
but you leave me no choice.

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:21.790
I'll devote my attention to advancing
my scheme at the summit.

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:23.080
Good luck with that.

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:25.750
You really put your heart into that one.

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:29.260
No, my heart has a previous engagement.

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:47.150
Let's get this summit going, shall we?

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:50.490
We must discuss the future of our empire.

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:59.620
Behold. That is our central market,
the great symbol of Mealtars.

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:02.670
There really is an
impressive selection of goods.

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:08.590
The sheer number of goods and vibrant
economic activity is our pride and joy.

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:12.430
I can't believe the mayor offered
to give us a personal tour.

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:17.560
Perhaps he's trying to
size up Natra through us.

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:22.940
This is also an important issue
in terms of public health!

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:27.150
There are more important things to spend
those funds on than an aqueduct!

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:30.650
Don't be ridiculous!
We must bring water to the entire city.

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:34.780
Otherwise, people's lives
will continue to be disrupted!

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:36.660
Wh-What is this?

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:40.750
A merchant city
should be run by merchants.

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:44.500
That is the sort of culture
we cultivate here in Mealtars.

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:49.170
We created this as a place where townsfolk
can gather and discuss public policy.

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:51.670
We call it the Citizens' Assembly.

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:53.760
Citizens' Assembly?

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:57.180
So, all these people are commoners?

00:16:57.180 --> 00:17:02.020
Yes, and the matters deliberated here are
brought before the Parliamentary Assembly

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:04.940
to assist in the decision-making process.

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:08.480
The people are helping
draft government policy

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:11.320
to improve their own lives.

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:15.030
So that's why they seem so earnest.

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:21.040
Yes, but I'm afraid today's debate
concerns the construction of an aqueduct.

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:24.540
I am so sorry, but you will
likely find it quite tedious.

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:26.290
Please allow me to show you--

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:28.130
No.

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:29.960
This will be fine.

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:34.590
That is, if it is permitted for
a foreigner such as I to listen in.

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:37.430
By all means, be my guest.

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:40.060
She has been well educated.

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:44.270
But at present, she is no more than
a provincial maiden from a good family.

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:48.730
Still, there is something more
to her than that.

00:17:48.730 --> 00:17:50.270
Damn it!

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:52.030
Damn them all!

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:55.150
Those foolish brothers of mine
should know their place!

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:58.450
How dare they lay claim
to the throne! It's mine!

00:17:58.450 --> 00:18:03.700
Why can't they see that such
disrespect deserves 10,000 deaths!

00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:07.830
As for Natra, we've gathered here
to crown the next emperor!

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:10.420
How dare they send such a little girl!

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:12.590
Damn you, Wein!

00:18:12.590 --> 00:18:17.880
You're a lowly provincial who got lucky,
but you've pushed that luck too far!

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:22.510
No one disrespects me
and gets away with it!

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:28.190
Yes, that's it.
I'll make you pay dearly for that.

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:36.150
She's exhausted from all that thinking.

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:39.740
I've never seen Her Highness
like that before.

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:43.080
She's off to the assembly again
tomorrow, but is that a good idea?

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:45.040
Let's see how she feels.

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:47.750
I don't want to interfere
with her personal growth.

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:48.960
Understood.

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:56.340
Yes, I'm not surprised
that she is sleeping.

00:18:56.340 --> 00:19:01.220
But the main reason
I am here is to speak with you.

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:02.760
With me?

00:19:03.510 --> 00:19:07.520
Aren't you interested in how
the summit went? You are, aren't you?

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:09.730
I thought you might be!

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:12.230
Oh, but that's too bad, isn't it?

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:18.400
If you had accepted my deal,
I could have told you how it went.

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:23.120
Stop! Time out, time out!
I'm the imperial princess!

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:24.660
This may seem presumptuous,

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:29.660
but there <i>is </i>such a thing as etiquette
between friends, Your Highness.

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:31.420
Come in.

00:19:31.420 --> 00:19:33.290
Forgive me, Lady Ninym!

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:35.800
What is it? Has something happened?

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:37.260
Y-Yes.

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:39.090
I must inform you that...

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:41.800
Prince Demetrio did what?!

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:46.560
What are <i>you </i>doing here, Lowellmina?

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:51.020
I simply wished to enjoy tea
with Princess Falanya.

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:55.520
Tell me, Prince Demetrio, to what
do I owe the pleasure of your visit?

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:58.150
There is but one reason for my visit.

00:19:58.150 --> 00:20:00.610
I have a proposal for Natra.

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:04.200
A proposal? And what might that be?

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:08.200
Princess Falanya, I would like
to take you as my bride.

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:14.670
Y-You wish for me... to be your bride?

00:20:14.670 --> 00:20:15.630
Indeed I do!

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:19.840
B-But why? It is all so sudden.

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:22.840
These troubled times
are all the more reason for

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:25.800
a close alliance between
the empire and Natra.

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:29.020
I wish to strengthen the bond
between our lands,

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:32.600
and I've come to the conclusion
that marriage is the answer!

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:35.480
He must have ulterior motives.

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:37.820
That is practically a given.

00:20:37.820 --> 00:20:39.900
I know, right?

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:43.490
Prince Demetrio,
your intentions are duly noted.

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:48.330
And I thank you for your proposal
to strengthen ties between us.

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:49.240
Then let us--

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:51.830
I shall convey your proposal
to Natra at once.

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:53.330
It may take time to--

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:55.920
No! I would have your answer now!

00:20:55.920 --> 00:20:58.750
Dear brother, that is an unreasonable--

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:00.840
You keep out of this!

00:21:00.840 --> 00:21:04.760
It is clear this marriage is in
the interests of both our lands.

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:08.350
There is no cause for debate,
wouldn't you agree?

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:11.730
Once she is my wife,
she becomes my property.

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:15.810
I can torment her however I wish,
and no one can say a thing.

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:21.230
Wein, I will make you regret ever
sending such a small child in your stead.

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:22.940
Now then, Princess Falanya!

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:26.110
Since Prince Wein is not here,
the decision rests with you,

00:21:26.110 --> 00:21:28.280
for you are a princess!

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:29.780
He's right.

00:21:29.780 --> 00:21:34.210
I came here in my brother's stead.

00:21:34.210 --> 00:21:40.960
And I'm certain he has rebuffed
such terrible coercion before.

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:43.210
I understand Your Highness's proposal.

00:21:43.210 --> 00:21:46.800
But royal marriages are
a matter of state affairs.

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:51.350
One as young and inexperienced as I
should not decide such things on her own.

00:21:51.350 --> 00:21:53.930
Wh-What?

00:21:53.930 --> 00:21:57.440
Yes, I saw it at the assembly as well.

00:21:59.560 --> 00:22:04.190
He has that look of
impatience and confusion.

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:07.280
So, you refuse to give me an answer, eh?

00:22:07.280 --> 00:22:08.620
Very well!

00:22:08.620 --> 00:22:12.660
If you wish to be so stubborn,
two can play that game!

00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:14.830
When I become emperor,

00:22:14.830 --> 00:22:19.960
your petty kingdom of Natra will
no longer be treated as it once was!

00:22:19.960 --> 00:22:21.420
Regretting it now?

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:24.590
Well, it's too late!
I <i>will </i>make you rue this day!

00:22:25.470 --> 00:22:28.430
If this is a matter concerning Natra,

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:30.800
I, too, would like to have a say!

00:22:30.800 --> 00:22:34.100
Pleased to make your acquaintance,
Prince Demetrio!

00:22:34.100 --> 00:22:36.230
I am the crown prince of Natra,

00:22:36.230 --> 00:22:39.190
Wein Salema Arbalest!
